  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "Japan Ground Self-Defense Force: a professional, highly trained, technology-heavy defensive force reorienting to the southwest island chain (Nansei islands) with the Amphibious Rapid Deployment Brigade, anti-ship missile units, Type 16 wheeled combat vehicles and a growing counter-strike capability. Strict legal limits on use of force abroad; overseas presence limited to the Djibouti base, PKO and evacuation operations.",
    "squad_size": 8,
    "fireteam": "Infantry squad of ~8 with Minimi team and rifle team; ARDB uses USMC-style fireteams. Game: 8 in four pairs.",
    "tactics": [
      "Defensive island operations: dug-in positions, anti-ship and anti-armour ambushes",
      "Amphibious counter-landing with AAV7 and V-22 from Osumi-class ships (ARDB)",
      "Precise, deliberate fire and movement; strong discipline and conservative rules of engagement",
      "Heavy use of Type 01 LMAT and Carl Gustaf in the anti-armour role",
      "Night operations with modern optics"
    ],
