  "notes": "Friendly mid-tier state (proposal). Japanese law restricts lethal arms exports (relaxed in 2023-24 for some transfers); proposal: Japan sells only non-lethal and protective gear at high reputation, no weapons or vehicles. Contracts are low-volume, high-trust (evacuations, maritime security). Real-world: major China-Japan diplomatic spat from November 2025 over Taiwan contingency remarks.",
